<div class="clear"></div></div></div></div>In the pre-raid Best in Slot gear for Feral Druid Tank you're going to be wearing items from various sources. A lot of it is "Binds when equipped" which means you can get it from the Auction House, but it might cost you a good amount of gold. Item level is by far the most important thing for Feral Druid Tank, so if you see any of the alternative items down below having a close item level but more affordable for you or farmable then do not feel bad about saving gold.<br/>
<br/>Below there will be PvP items included, that do not require any rating. Due to the high item level on these items even though you lose an entire secondary stat to the useless Resilience, they still pull ahead with the amount of Stamina and Agility you gain from them as well as the set bonuses. Some of these items are better than the items in the sets above, but I did not want to include PvP items in these sets. The PvP items that are better will be reflected in the lists below.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Feral Druid Tank</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-feral-druid-tank">Head for Feral Druid Tank</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70280/ruthless-gladiators-dragonhide-helm">
<img alt="Ruthless Gladiator's Dragonhide Helm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_leather_pvpdruid_c_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ruthless Gladiator's Dragonhide Helm</span></a> is the best helm you can get pre-raid as a Feral Druid Tank for survivability, but <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60286/stormriders-headpiece">
<img alt="Stormrider's Headpiece" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormrider's Headpiece</span></a> pulls ahead if you can get the 2-set bonus in damage done with only a small loss in survivability. If you get either of the set bonuses with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70280/ruthless-gladiators-dragonhide-helm">
<img alt="Ruthless Gladiator's Dragonhide Helm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_leather_pvpdruid_c_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ruthless Gladiator's Dragonhide Helm</span></a>, it pulls ahead in both factors for a Main-Tank Feral.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62366/arcanum-of-the-earthen-ring">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Earthen Ring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Earthen Ring</span></a> (Main-Tank) | <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62369/arcanum-of-the-ramkahen">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Ramkahen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Ramkahen</span></a> (Off-Tank).<div class="pad"></div>
