<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-feral-druid-tank">Shoulders for Feral Druid Tank</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70283/ruthless-gladiators-dragonhide-spaulders">
<img alt="Ruthless Gladiator's Dragonhide Spaulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_leather_pvpdruid_c_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ruthless Gladiator's Dragonhide Spaulders</span></a> is the best item for your shoulder slot you can get pre-raid as a Feral Druid Tank for survivability, but <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60289/stormriders-spaulders">
<img alt="Stormrider's Spaulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormrider's Spaulders</span></a> pulls ahead if you can get the 2-set bonus in damage done with only a small loss in survivability. If you get either of the set bonuses with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70283/ruthless-gladiators-dragonhide-spaulders">
<img alt="Ruthless Gladiator's Dragonhide Spaulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_leather_pvpdruid_c_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ruthless Gladiator's Dragonhide Spaulders</span></a>, it pulls ahead in both factors for a Main-Tank Feral.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=226459/greater-inscription-of-unbreakable-quartz">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Unbreakable Quartz" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_crystal_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Unbreakable Quartz</span></a> (Main-Tank) | <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=226460/greater-inscription-of-shattered-crystal">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Shattered Crystal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_goldendraenite_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Shattered Crystal</span></a> (Off-Tank)<div class="pad"></div>
