<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-feral-druid-tank">Back for Feral Druid Tank</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70386/ruthless-gladiators-cape-of-cruelty">
<img alt="Ruthless Gladiator's Cape of Cruelty" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ruthless Gladiator's Cape of Cruelty</span></a> is the best defensive cloak you can get pre-raid as a Feral Druid Tank, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69884/mistral-drape">
<img alt="Mistral Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_melee_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mistral Drape</span></a>, through <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>, is slightly better offensively. Ideally, you want <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69884&amp;&amp;rand=-137">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_melee_d_01.gif");'>
<span class="q4">Mistral Drape of the Windstorm</span></span></a>, however, the other suffixes are not far behind and are still better than the other options.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74234/enchant-cloak-protection">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Protection</span></a> (Main-Tank) | <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=60663/enchant-cloak-major-agility">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Major Agility</span></a> (Off-Tank)<div class="pad"></div>
