<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-feral-druid-tank">Chest for Feral Druid Tank</h4>The pre-raid Best in Slot option for Feral Druid Tank is going to be <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71100/obsidian-arborweave-raiment">
<img alt="Obsidian Arborweave Raiment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_raiddruid_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Arborweave Raiment</span></a> from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. This chest is a lot stronger than your other alternatives when benefitting from the 2-set bonus, however, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70282/ruthless-gladiators-dragonhide-robes">
<img alt="Ruthless Gladiator's Dragonhide Robes" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_pvpdruid_c_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ruthless Gladiator's Dragonhide Robes</span></a> is only slightly worse standalone and pulls ahead if you can get a set bonus with it and not with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71100/obsidian-arborweave-raiment">
<img alt="Obsidian Arborweave Raiment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_raiddruid_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Arborweave Raiment</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74251/enchant-chest-greater-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Greater Stamina</span></a> (Main-Tank) | <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
