<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-feral-druid-tank">Wrist for Feral Druid Tank</h4>The pre-raid Best in Slot bracers for Feral Druid Tank is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71130/flamebinder-bracers">
<img alt="Flamebinder Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_leather_raidrogue_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flamebinder Bracers</span></a> which are bought with<a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
