<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-feral-druid-tank">Waist for Feral Druid Tank</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60231/belt-of-the-fallen-brood">
<img alt="Belt of the Fallen Brood" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_leatherraidrogue_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Fallen Brood</span></a> is by far your best option as a Feral Druid Tank and acquired through the Inferno Protocol Dungeon currency, <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70347/ruthless-gladiators-waistband-of-cruelty">
<img alt="Ruthless Gladiator's Waistband of Cruelty" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_leather_pvprogue_c_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ruthless Gladiator's Waistband of Cruelty</span></a> is not too far behind defensively, but all the other options are significantly worse.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Waist Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55054/ebonsteel-belt-buckle">
<img alt="Ebonsteel Belt Buckle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ebonsteel Belt Buckle</span></a>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Waist Tinker for Engineers</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=41118/nitro-boosts">
<img alt="Nitro Boosts" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_rocketbootextreme.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a>
