<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-feral-druid-tank">Legs for Feral Druid Tank</h4>Your pre-raid Best in Slot legs as a Feral Druid Tank is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71099/obsidian-arborweave-legguards">
<img alt="Obsidian Arborweave Legguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_leather_raiddruid_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Arborweave Legguards</span></a> which you can buy with 2200 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. This will be your best option even if you do not get the 2-set bonus from wearing them, but it is even more powerful if you can get the 2-set. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60288/stormriders-legguards">
<img alt="Stormrider's Legguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormrider's Legguards</span></a> will be your best option if you get the 2-set bonus from wearing them and don't lose a <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71099/obsidian-arborweave-legguards">
<img alt="Obsidian Arborweave Legguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_leather_raiddruid_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Arborweave Legguards</span></a> set bonus.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56551/charscale-leg-armor">
