<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-feral-druid-tank">Rings for Feral Druid Tank</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71209/splintered-brimstone-seal">
<img alt="Splintered Brimstone Seal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_firelandsraid_03b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Splintered Brimstone Seal</span></a> from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> is by far the best ring you can get pre-raid. For your other slot<br/>
<a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63488&amp;&amp;rand=-137">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubystar.gif");'>
<span class="q4">Mistral Circle of the Windstorm</span></span></a> will be your best option, however, the other versions of this ring are also good and are the best alternatives for this slot.<div class="pad"></div>
