<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="defensive-trinkets-for-feral-druid-tank">Defensive Trinkets for Feral Druid Tank</h4>Feral Druid Tanks love Stamina so any trinkets that provide Stamina will be your strongest defensively. The best ones that are available pre-raid are going to be <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65109/vial-of-stolen-memories">
<img alt="Vial of Stolen Memories" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cat_trinket02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vial of Stolen Memories</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65048/symbiotic-worm">
<img alt="Symbiotic Worm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qiraj_skinsandworm.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Symbiotic Worm</span></a>. which can be bought for 50 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> each. The optional <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70143/moonwell-phial">
<img alt="Moonwell Phial" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_alchemy_imbuedvial.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Moonwell Phial</span></a> is available through the <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a> quest hub, where you have to complete <a class="icontiny" data-entity="quest" data-game="wow" data-type="quest" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/quest=29279/filling-the-moonwell">
<img alt="Filling the Moonwell" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Filling the Moonwell</span></a>, more info <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/molten-front-zone-overview">here</a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68915/scales-of-life">
<img alt="Scales of Life" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_druid_balanceofpower.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scales of Life</span></a> is better than all the items on this list, but comes from inside the raid, it is Binds on Equip so it's technically possible to get before entering the raid yourself from the Auction House.<div class="pad"></div>
