<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Feral Druid Tank</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="two-handed-weapons-for-feral-druid-tank">Two-handed Weapons for Feral Druid Tank</h4>In Phase 3 we get access to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70165/witch-hunters-harvester">
<img alt="Witch-Hunter's Harvester" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_polearm_2h_bwdraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Witch-Hunter's Harvester</span></a> which is crafted with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=164/blacksmithing">
<img alt="Blacksmithing" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_blacksmithing.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blacksmithing</span></a>, the recipe is acquired through the new <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a> quest hub. <br/>The best weapon you can get access to before entering the raid yourself is the Binds on Equip, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71361/ranseur-of-hatred">
<img alt="Ranseur of Hatred" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_polearm_2h_firelandsraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ranseur of Hatred</span></a>, however, it comes from inside the raid and will likely be expensive or impossible to come by early on in the phase.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=95471/enchant-2h-weapon-mighty-agility">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant 2H Weapon - Mighty Agility</span></a> (Main-Tank and Off-Tank)<div class="pad"></div>
